Rule 2 (weights must be a 1D tensor and its size must match the first dimension of sample)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
